01:13:01.560 --> 01:13:05.350
The idea really there is
that-- so for example,

01:13:05.350 --> 01:13:10.460
I can have mean absolute
error as well as my LPIPS.

01:13:10.460 --> 01:13:14.900
And this is actually quite
